// Direct to greeting
-> greeting

=== greeting ===
Barrington! Glad I found ye.

Fear not, I know ye did not mean to break me ship. Ye were just tryin' to help. Besides! A good pirate is never beaten without a ship.

We'll look for some ship parts to build ye a grand vessel!

Aye, the waves here are always going to be rough, but I picked up a trick along the way!

When the waves are tough, I try to breathe along with the tide!

Breathe in like the ship going up, right to the top! Breathing out while ye descend. It be like yer one with the waves.

What do you think?
* [I'll be a strong captain!] -> farewell
* [I can steer through any storm!] -> farewell
* [No wave can defeat me!] -> farewell


=== farewell === 
That's the spirit! Keep remindin' yerself of that.

Yer a chip off the old block, ye'll make a great pirate in no time. Good luck, Captain! -> END